<title>USA: NYSE Unavailable -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailable -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that Department 56 Inc was not available for news pending.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA, Freeport-McMoran Copper &amp; Gold Inc and WCI Steel Inc also were unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
